---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — OnlineCheckPrinter"
  description="Who we are and why we built OnlineCheckPrinter.com."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">About</h1>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <p>
        <strong>OnlineCheckPrinter.com</strong> exists to answer one specific question well:
        <em>which check-printing service or software actually makes sense for your business,
        and at what volume does it start paying for itself?</em>
      </p>

      <p>
        Most small businesses that still write paper checks — for payroll, vendors, or rent —
        default to whatever their bank or accounting software offers, without ever running the
        numbers against a dedicated service or a DIY setup. Between those options lies a real
        cost difference, and a real fraud-risk difference, that most guides gloss over.
      </p>

      <h2>How we write our reviews</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Math first.</strong> Every recommendation includes the break-even calculation.
          If a "cheap" option costs more at your actual volume, we say so.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Independence.</strong> We use affiliate links to fund the site, but we rank by
          what we'd actually recommend to a friend — not by which partner pays the highest
          commission.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Regular updates.</strong> Vendor pricing, integrations, and fraud-prevention
          programs all change. We review our top picks each quarter.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>

      <p>
        Our editorial team has backgrounds in small business finance, accounting, and payment
        risk. We are not financial advisors, and nothing on this site is personalized
        financial or legal advice — always run your own numbers and consult a professional for
        decisions that matter.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>

      <p>
        Have a tip, correction, or a service you think we should review? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@onlinecheckprinter.com">hello@onlinecheckprinter.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
